<title>USA: Sunrise, Fla., utility deal repriced, ylds lowered.</title>
<headline>Sunrise, Fla., utility deal repriced, ylds lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R Hough &amp; Co said Monday it repriced Sunrise, Fla.'s $142.8 million utility bond issue, lowering yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2026 unchanged at approximately 5.938 percent.</p>
